<title>UKRAINE: HRYVNIA UNCHANGED AT 1.8550 PER DLR IN KIEV.</title>
<headline>HRYVNIA UNCHANGED AT 1.8550 PER DLR IN KIEV.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
